  "remarks": "Limited Liability Company “Anzhersky Oil Refinery” is a Russian holding that owns LLC “Anzhersky Oil and Gas Company LLC” and LLC “Oil Refinery “North Kuzbass”, two Russian companies involved in the production of petroleum products and operating on the Yaya oil refining site in the Kemerovo Oblast. Limited Liability Company “Anzhersky Oil Refinery” is co-owned by Yuri Kushnerov, the Chairman of the Board of Directors of JSC Neftechemservis which owns the Yaya oil refinery.",
